WEBVTT

00:00:05.348 --> 00:00:06.448
[bones cracking]
[Sonic] Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:00:06.508 --> 00:00:08.428
Are you kidding me
with that handshake?

00:00:10.848 --> 00:00:12.408
[Wade] I'm done
playing games, pal.

00:00:14.468 --> 00:00:15.827
You're gonna tell me
what I want to know.

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:21.967
And I am asking you
for the last time...

00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:26.338
what would you like
on your bagel?

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:28.037
I'm not telling you
anything.

00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:31.378
And that is a display bagel.

00:00:31.758 --> 00:00:34.537
I don't get it with you!
I mean, I've tried everything.

00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:36.758
I was good cop.
I was bad cop.

00:00:36.918 --> 00:00:38.558
I was cop
who offers you a bagel.

00:00:38.758 --> 00:00:39.898
And nothing.
It's like--

00:00:39.898 --> 00:00:41.438
That is a display bagel.
Wow.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.177
[rumbling]

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.655
[electronic warbling]

00:00:47.563 --> 00:00:49.038
[yells]

00:00:51.647 --> 00:00:52.787
Doctor, you're here.

00:00:55.528 --> 00:00:59.728
[in electronic voice]
Yes, I'm here,
and yet I'm...

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:02.728
not all there.

00:01:03.287 --> 00:01:04.447
Sir, are you feeling okay?

00:01:05.027 --> 00:01:07.767
I'm more than okay.

00:01:09.408 --> 00:01:10.427
I'm upgraded.

00:01:13.008 --> 00:01:14.887
[singsongy] Sinister 3.0.

00:01:15.647 --> 00:01:18.927
My game is next level.

00:01:19.043 --> 00:01:23.327
[warped vocalizing]

00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:26.365
Hi.
[screams]

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:34.588
I can smell the electricity
in your brain.

00:01:34.731 --> 00:01:36.874
[sniffs]

00:01:37.018 --> 00:01:38.978
You smell like
a snack plate.

00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:43.418
Yeah, no, that's fair.
I had a couple today.

00:01:44.118 --> 00:01:45.338
Sit down.

00:01:49.947 --> 00:01:51.088
In the chair.

00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:57.112
I didn't know.

00:01:57.237 --> 00:02:00.537
'Cause he was in the chair,
so I didn't-- Okay.

00:02:01.018 --> 00:02:02.197
Sir? We have a problem.

00:02:08.131 --> 00:02:11.356
[soldier 1]
All teams in position!
[soldier] Set up a perimeter!

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:13.370
[soldier] Move! Move! Move!

00:02:29.197 --> 00:02:31.517
Incorrectus,
my trusty barnacle.

00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:35.277
After all these years,

00:02:35.878 --> 00:02:37.677
what I finally got...

00:02:38.737 --> 00:02:40.317
is a solution.

00:02:51.428 --> 00:02:53.428
Commander.
Status report.

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:56.928
Robotnik is in there
with Stone and a hostage.
Possibly local PD.

00:02:57.368 --> 00:03:00.048
I'm not saying he's dumb,
but if he is local PD,

00:03:00.488 --> 00:03:01.828
this town's
in a lot of trouble.

00:03:01.935 --> 00:03:03.482
[both] Wade.

00:03:15.277 --> 00:03:17.075
Um...

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:19.298
Okay.

00:03:20.678 --> 00:03:22.678
Rockin' that new
spring collection, I see.

00:03:23.258 --> 00:03:26.617
Well, if it isn't
the Pastry King.

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:28.697
The Donut Lord.

00:03:29.498 --> 00:03:31.718
A real genius would remember
the name of the guy

00:03:31.718 --> 00:03:33.418
who helped kick your butt
off this planet.

00:03:33.558 --> 00:03:35.358
And I'll do it again
if you mess with Green Hills.

00:03:36.737 --> 00:03:40.077
Congratulations
on your oh-so-temporary
sense of superiority.

00:03:40.598 --> 00:03:42.678
You're finished, Robotnik!
We've taken everything.

00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:45.378
Your lab, your drones,
your funding!

00:03:45.798 --> 00:03:48.898
Let's see how big of a man
you are without
your silly little robots.

00:03:50.238 --> 00:03:53.577
Would you like to see how...

00:03:53.577 --> 00:03:55.518
big a man I can be?

00:04:06.948 --> 00:04:09.748
Welcome to the new norm.

00:04:20.408 --> 00:04:21.528
My God!

00:04:24.809 --> 00:04:28.824
Doctor! Take me with you!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.363
[screaming]

00:04:39.507 --> 00:04:41.323
[train horn blowing]

00:04:53.297 --> 00:04:54.778
He's taking everything apart.

00:04:56.198 --> 00:04:57.418
He's building something.

00:05:05.487 --> 00:05:08.009
[Tails]
That can only be one thing.

00:05:08.117 --> 00:05:10.459
The fearsome power
of the Emerald.

00:05:10.567 --> 00:05:12.548
If that thing really
turns thoughts into power,

00:05:12.748 --> 00:05:14.248
we are in big trouble.

00:05:14.728 --> 00:05:16.708
Robotnik has a lot
of bad thoughts.

00:05:16.847 --> 00:05:19.328
Hey, Sonic, are you sure
it was a good idea

00:05:19.328 --> 00:05:20.708
bringing
you-know-who aboard?

00:05:21.347 --> 00:05:25.068
Knuckles isn't really a bad guy.
He's just a little mixed up.

00:05:25.228 --> 00:05:26.608
I am not mixed up!

00:05:27.168 --> 00:05:30.268
I have steely focus.
And I'm complex.

00:05:31.229 --> 00:05:32.884
And that's a lot
for some people.

00:05:32.986 --> 00:05:36.161
[chuckles]
Hope you're not still mad
I hit you with that car.

00:05:36.263 --> 00:05:38.493
Pfft!
I was completely uninjured.

00:05:38.594 --> 00:05:42.175
And my revenge will come
when you least expect it, fox.

